/*
 * Context rows (DESIGN.md "Context Row"): the Conversation Row geometry for
 * list contexts whose rows are not threads (Reminders, later Drafts). The
 * 36px row, 6px inset, 44px gutter, focus fill and lavender bar are the
 * `.inbox-row` rules above. The row's one button (`.context-row-main`) carries
 * the subject on the 50px content inset; quiet row actions appear on the
 * current, hovered or focus-within row and stay Tab-reachable; the trailing
